  "title": "Vertiv Introduces High-Capacity DC Distribution Bays With Intelligent Load Management",
  "summary": "Vertiv, formerly Emerson Network Power, today introduced the NetSure™ 8100DB series of DC power distribution systems, bringing increased visibility and intelligent load management to telecom, data center and cable industry power infrastructure facilities. The NetSure 8100DB remotely monitors the power draw on individual breakers/fuses, identifying the equipment being used and enabling load shifts to protect sites from potential overload. Netsure 8100DB is globally available now.",
